<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11658" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crŏcĭnus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόκινος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>pertaining to saffron,
				saffron-</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semen,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin. 21, 19, 73, 124</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unguentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					3, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">color,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tunica,</span>”
				<i>saffron-colored</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					68, 134</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crŏcĭnum</span></b> , i,
				n. (sc. oleum), <i>saffron-oil</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Prop.
			3</span></i> (4), 10, 22.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>The color of saffron, saffron-yellow</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 32, 1, 78, §
			5</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, as a term of endearment, <i><span class="en">Plaut. Curc.
				1, 2, 7</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
